WEBVTT

00:07:56.830 --> 00:08:01.597
I started feeling a real desire
to keep on running,

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:04.797
not because I felt like I should
be exercising more,

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.397
or because I felt like I needed
to impress my neighbors or something,

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:12.163
but because it felt more natural
to keep running

00:08:12.197 --> 00:08:14.063
than it felt to stop.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:18.897
Now, I of all people know
that it can be incredibly tempting,

00:08:18.897 --> 00:08:21.630
especially for the
overachievers among us --

00:08:21.663 --> 00:08:23.163
you know who you are --

00:08:23.197 --> 00:08:25.597
to encourage ourselves to do more

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.730
than our designated
better-than-nothing habit.

00:08:29.163 --> 00:08:31.430
So I must warn you: